Save as %USERPROFILE%\.cursor\hooks.json (merge with what's there):
{
  "version": 1,
  "hooks": {
    "beforeSubmitPrompt":  [{ "command": "mochi-cli hook cursor", "timeout": 5 }],
    "postToolUse":         [{ "command": "mochi-cli hook cursor", "timeout": 5 }],
    "afterShellExecution": [{ "command": "mochi-cli hook cursor", "timeout": 5 }],
    "afterFileEdit":       [{ "command": "mochi-cli hook cursor", "timeout": 5 }],
    "stop":                [{ "command": "mochi-cli hook cursor", "timeout": 5 }],
    "sessionEnd":          [{ "command": "mochi-cli hook cursor", "timeout": 5 }]
  }
}
Cursor has no event for "waiting for your approval", so that state isn't shown.
